DISCLAIMER

This software is designed for educational and research purposes in agricultural
automation. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy and reliability,
the authors and contributors make no warranties about the suitability of this
software for commercial poultry operations or critical applications.

Users are advised to:
- Thoroughly test the system in their specific environment
- Validate counting accuracy against manual counts
- Implement appropriate safeguards and backup systems
- Comply with local regulations and animal welfare standards

The software may not be suitable for applications where incorrect counts could
result in animal welfare issues, financial losses, or regulatory violations.

